# Performance

- Paginate lists. Whitelist sort fields. Do not load a relation per row.
- Use the indexes named in the ERD and `docs/database/DATABASE_DESIGN.md`.
- Do not add a Redis response cache unless a measured endpoint misses the target in `docs/engineering/PERFORMANCE_AND_SCALABILITY.md`.
- Do not call the payment gateway or SMS provider inside a stock transaction.
